      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This paper presents an extensive review of contributions on opiate controlled descending projections modulating analgesia. While there is a quite definite agreement on the organisation and structure of these projections, their true physiological role remains quite dubious. The hypothesis so far formulated on the modalities of activation of these circuits apparently don't hold a critical re-examination."},
